OL,3,AChina suspends rescue efforts at
OL,4,ANepal-Tibet border due to risk of
OL,5,Asecond flood
OL,6,
OL,7,FChinese authorities have suspended
OL,8,Fflood rescue efforts near the
OL,9,FNepal-Tibet border over fears that a
OL,10,Fnewly formed lake of rising water could
OL,11,Fburst its banks
OL,13,FThe death toll has now risen to 475,
OL,14,FNepal Police says, more than 48 hours
OL,15,Fafter flash flooding devastated the
OL,16,FHimalayan border region
OL,18,FIn Tibet, three people have died and
OL,19,Fmore than 550 are missing. It is not
OL,20,Fclear if the latest figures overlap
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
