OL,3,AChina suspends rescue efforts at
OL,4,ANepal-Tibet border due to risk of
OL,5,Asecond flood
OL,6,
OL,7,FRescuers searching for survivors are
OL,8,F"on edge" over the reports that a
OL,9,Fsecond flood could hit the disaster
OL,10,Fzone, a Red Cross official tells the
OL,11,FBBC
OL,13,FA collapsed glacier caused the huge
OL,14,Fflood wave, local officials tell the
OL,15,FBBC. The surge tore through houses and
OL,16,Froads, and destroyed a key Nepal-Tibet
OL,17,Fborder crossing
